23:08.990 --> 23:24.000
Episode Preview

23:09.940 --> 23:11.480
Charlotte here!

23:11.480 --> 23:12.690
Pandemonium...

23:12.690 --> 23:15.040
What a noble, awe-inspiring name!

23:15.040 --> 23:18.240
It's a place where demons can all get along!

23:18.240 --> 23:20.110
Next episode: "Meeting of the Round Table".

23:18.750 --> 23:23.990
<b>Meeting of the Round Table</b>

23:20.110 --> 23:22.830
It's finally time for me 
to take command as leader!
